==============================================================================
profile (3,): |box|=4 = |cube|=2 + directions r=1 + apex 1;  non-squarefree divisors |Q|=2
profile (2, 1, 1): |box|=12 = |cube|=8 + directions r=3 + apex 1;  non-squarefree divisors |Q|=4
N=60=2^2*3*5: non-squarefree divisors Q=[4, 12, 20, 60]; Q minus N = image of the atoms under l -> p*lcm(p,l) (2->4, 3->12, 5->20); apex N=60
  hostile: d -> d/p sends Q onto the upper cube face p*D(m) = [2, 6, 10, 30], not onto the atoms
profile (2,1^(r-1)): |Q| = 2^(r-1) = (upper cube face through p) and 2^(r-1) = r+1 iff r=3 (checked r<=8)

